{
  "slug": "mcp-apps-plugin",
  "name": "Mcp Apps Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Helps you build an MCP App",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `add-app-to-server` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"add an app to my MCP server\", \"add…), `convert-web-app` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"add MCP App support to my web app\",…), `create-mcp-app` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create an MCP App\", \"add a UI to…), `migrate-oai-app` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"migrate from OpenAI Apps SDK\", \"convert OpenAI App…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp-apps-plugin@claude-community` from `modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps` (`plugins/mcp-apps`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
